+**Assertions:** `cfg.DB.Path == "/custom/memory.db"`.
+
+## TestLoadFileRef_MissingFile_ReturnsError
+**Scenario:** Load with a {file.*} reference to a missing file returns an error.
+**Setup:** Write TOML with `api_key = "{file./nonexistent}"`.
+**Assertions:** `Load` returns a non-nil error.
+
+## TestLoadFileRef_DefaultsAppliedAfterExpansion
+**Scenario:** A file-resolved non-empty value is not overwritten by applyDefaults.
